{"title":"Career roadmap · Trade Compliance Executive","role":"Trade Compliance Executive","summary":"A Trade Compliance Executive helps organisations ensure that imports, exports, shipments, documentation, products, counterparties and transactions comply with applicable trade laws, customs requirements, sanctions controls, export controls and internal policies.","facts":{},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The strongest career combination is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["BBA International Business","Import/Export Operations","Customs","Trade Documentation","HS Classification","Sanctions/Export Controls","Excel/ERP","Trade Data Analytics","Compliance","Internship"],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Typical Roles","Focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"Entry"},{"text":"Trade Compliance Executive"},{"text":"Compliance and documentation"}],[{"text":"Entry"},{"text":"Import/Export Executive"},{"text":"International trade operations"}],[{"text":"Entry"},{"text":"Trade Operations Associate"},{"text":"Shipment and documentation"}],[{"text":"Entry"},{"text":"Customs Compliance Associate"},{"text":"Customs processes"}],[{"text":"Entry"},{"text":"Global Trade Operations Associate"},{"text":"Cross-border transactions"}],[{"text":"2–4 Years"},{"text":"Trade Compliance Analyst"},{"text":"Classification and compliance review"}],[{"text":"3–6 Years"},{"text":"Senior Trade Compliance Analyst"},{"text":"Complex transactions and controls"}],[{"text":"4–7 Years"},{"text":"Global Trade Compliance Specialist"},{"text":"Multi-country compliance"}],[{"text":"5–10 Years"},{"text":"Trade Compliance Manager"},{"text":"Governance and risk"}],[{"text":"8–12 Years"},{"text":"Global Trade Compliance Manager"},{"text":"International programme management"}],[{"text":"Long Term"},{"text":"Head of Trade Compliance / Global Trade Governance"},{"text":"Strategic lea